    ns76:_build_unique_members_component.UniqueMembersConstraintComponent dcterms:identifier "starlayer.shacl.native_components._build_unique_members_component.UniqueMembersConstraintComponent" ;
        a ns2:Class ;
        rdfs:comment """``sh:uniqueMembers``: each value node must be a well-formed SHACL
    list with no duplicate members.

    ``sh:uniqueMembers false`` is an explicit opt-out (matches
    ``sh:singleLine false``'s treatment) - not itself a constraint, not
    even a "must be a list" check.""" ;
