    ns75:StarShaclSchema.validate.param.rdfs_subclass_reasoning_includes_shapes_graph a ns2:Parameter ;
        rdfs:comment "Whether ``sh:rootClass``'s own ``rdfs:subClassOf`` reasoning should also consult the shapes graph's own ``rdfs:subClassOf`` triples, not just the data graph's - SHACL 1.2 Core's \"SHACL Type\" definition explicitly allows this to be implementation-parameterized. When enabled, the shapes graph's own ``rdfs:subClassOf`` triples are injected into a copy of ``data_graph`` handed to pySHACL (the only channel available, since pySHACL constructs the ``sh:rootClass`` component itself with no room for extra constructor arguments) and removed again afterward." ;
