    standalone file directly. Without this,
    ``get_ontology_graph(name).serialize(...)`` falls back to rdflib's own
    auto-generated ``ns1:``/``ns2:`` prefixes instead of the expected
    ``salg:``/``sqe:`` - breaking real downstream callers
