        variable: The unbound variable named in `PV`.
        projected_vars: The node's full `PV`, for context.""" ;
        rdfs:label "UnboundProjectedVariable" ;
        ns2:filePath "/Users/johnclements/Documents/GitHub/hidden-graph/starlayer/packages/starlayer/starlayer/sparql/salg/semantic_checks.py" ;
