    ns28:StarLayerGraph._infer_rdf_before_and_delta dcterms:identifier "starlayer.graph.graph.starlayer_graph.StarLayerGraph._infer_rdf_before_and_delta" ;
        a ns2:Method ;
        rdfs:comment """Compute RDF entailment (RDF 1.2 Semantics) natively - no
    ``owlrl``/reasoner dependency at all, unlike every other regime
    this class supports, since this one rule is small enough to just
    implement directly:

    - **rdfD2**: for every distinct predicate ``aaa`` used anywhere in
      self, entail ``aaa rdf:type rdf:Property``.
    - **RDF axiomatic triples**: a small fixed set
      (``rdf:type``/``subject``/``predicate``/``object``/``reifies``/
      ``first``/``rest``/``value`` ``rdf:type rdf:Property``;
      ``rdf:nil rdf:type rdf:List``; ``rdf:_N rdf:type rdf:Property``
      for each container index ``N`` actually used) - only
      instantiated for terms genuinely present in self, never the
      full (infinite, for ``rdf:_N``) schema unconditionally.

    **Deliberately deferred, not implemented here**: rdfD1/rdfD1a
    (datatype literal value-space well-typing - e.g. asserting a
    blank node typed by a literal's own datatype IRI). Lower
    practical value for SHACL validation than the two rules above,
    and a materially different kind of check (datatype value-space
    membership, not plain graph-pattern matching) - a real v1 scope
    reduction, not an oversight. Revisit if a real caller needs it.

    No external reasoner is invoked here, so there's no triple-term
    crash risk ``_decompose()`` exists to avoid for the owlrl-backed
    regimes, and nothing needs decomposing first - ``delta`` is built
    directly against ``self``.""" ;
        rdfs:label "_infer_rdf_before_and_delta" ;
        ns2:calls ns28:StarLayerGraph._infer_rdf_before_and_delta._maybe_add_property_type ;
        ns2:declares ns28:StarLayerGraph._infer_rdf_before_and_delta._maybe_add_property_type ;
        ns2:filePath "/Users/johnclements/Documents/GitHub/hidden-graph/starlayer/packages/starlayer/starlayer/graph/graph/starlayer_graph.py" ;
        ns2:hasReturnValue ns28:StarLayerGraph._infer_rdf_before_and_delta.returns ;
        ns2:isPrivate true ;
        ns2:lineEnd 2960 ;
        ns2:lineStart 2890 ;
        ns2:signature "def _infer_rdf_before_and_delta(self)" .

